                        "developer_response": "Aww, you really took us on a whole little adventure with this review 🥹❤️ We loved reading your thoughts on the puzzles, exploration, Adam and Evelyn, the 1920s setting, and all those hidden ruins, ancient mechanisms, and mysterious places along the way.\n\nIt’s so nice to hear that the puzzle-focused gameplay and story kept you interested, especially the way you described stopping to study clues, figure things out, and slowly uncover what’s behind each part of the journey. That really fits the kind of adventure Adam’s Venture Chronicles is all about 🎮🤗\n\nWe also really appreciate how thoughtfully you went through the different parts of the game, from the environments and soundtrack to the platforming, camera, progression, and overall presentation. You gave such a clear picture of what worked for you and where the experience could feel smoother, and that kind of detailed feedback is always lovely to read.\n\nAnd 10+ hours with a 7/10 after such a proper playthrough, Thank you for giving Adam’s Venture Chronicles your time and for putting so much thought into sharing your experience with us. ❤️",
